#: contact.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Contacting the &kde; developers"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: contact.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "On this page, you can find links to &kde; related web sites."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: contact.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The K Desktop Environment is developed by a large group of people around the "
"world. Our main communication channel is the Internet. For general "
"questions, you will be best served by asking on the mailing lists mentioned "
"in the <link linkend=\"contact-mailinglists\">previous section</link>, and "
"contact addresses for individual developers can be found in the "
"documentation of their individual application."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: contact.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please visit our <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/contact/representatives.php"
"\">Official Representatives</ulink> page for official enquiries regarding "
"&kde; (&eg; interviews)."
